        <pre id="pane-shell" class="m-0 p-5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><span class="c-comment"># clone, install, run — one terminal</span>
<span class="c-prompt">$ </span><span class="c-fn">git clone</span> github.com/backlex/backlex &amp;&amp; <span class="c-kw">cd</span> backlex
<span class="c-prompt">$ </span><span class="c-fn">bun install</span>
<span class="c-prompt">$ </span><span class="c-fn">cp</span> apps/web/.dev.vars.example apps/web/.dev.vars

<span class="c-comment"># migrate local sqlite, then start vite + miniflare</span>
<span class="c-prompt">$ </span><span class="c-fn">bun run</span> db:migrate:sqlite
<span class="c-prompt">$ </span><span class="c-fn">bun run</span> dev

  <span class="c-comment">▸</span> ready in <span class="c-num">2.3s</span> on <span class="c-str">http://localhost:5173</span>
  <span class="c-comment">▸</span> sign up the first user at /sign-up
  <span class="c-comment">▸</span> first user auto-gets the <span class="c-key">admin</span> role</pre>
        <pre id="pane-curl" hidden class="m-0 p-5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><span class="c-comment"># list items from the auto-generated REST endpoint</span>
