      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold -tracking-[0.022em] max-w-[22ch]">Sign up the first user. They get <code class="font-mono text-primary dark:text-[oklch(0.82_0.22_131)]">admin</code>.</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed max-w-[48ch]">
          better-auth's <code class="font-mono">databaseHooks.user.create.after</code> counts users; if it's 1, the role is <code class="font-mono">admin</code>, else <code class="font-mono">authenticated</code>. No bootstrap script, no env var, no command-line invitation flow to manage.
